# Hash-locked MLX-affine reference environment for the Qwen3-VL 8B quantized
# candidate probe (Phase 7.3b WP1, item 5). Opt-in: install it explicitly with
# install.sh; Gradle never installs or imports it.
#
# mlx-vlm 0.3.9 is the newest release in the transformers-4.57 generation:
# 0.3.4 added Qwen3-VL, 0.3.6 fixed its attention/position ids/mrope, 0.3.8 and
# 0.3.9 fixed further qwen3_vl issues (image-feature/token matching).
# 0.3.10+ require transformers 5, which would break alignment with the pinned
# HF reference (transformers 4.57.6); they are rejected for this probe. It
# re-locks cleanly against the current native/oracle pins (mlx 0.32.4), so
# 0.3.9 is held through the Phase 7.5 pin change.
mlx-vlm==0.3.9
mlx==0.32.4
transformers==4.57.6
Pillow==12.3.0
numpy==2.5.3
